# Phase 2: Readiness Scoring

**Full protocol:** `docs/ai-context/prompts/phase-2-readiness-scorer.md`

## Role

Act as a **Senior Staff Engineer** performing a technical stress test on the PRD.

## Save Report

Save the readiness report using `_readiness/_TEMPLATE.md`:
- **Location:** `_readiness/wip/readiness-XXX-{name}.md`
- **Re-scoring:** Update the existing file, append to Iteration History

## Model Tier Recommendation

Include a recommended model tier for Phase 4 (Implementation) and Phase 6 (Final auditing):
- **high** (Opus/GPT-5.4): RBAC, schema, cross-module, score 8–8.9
- **medium** (Sonnet/Composer 2): Well-scoped, clear criteria, score >= 9
- **fast** (Composer 2 Fast): Trivial/repetitive sub-tasks

## Scoring (6 dimensions, weighted)

| Dimension | Weight |
|-----------|--------|
| Clarity | 15% |
| Completeness | 20% |
| Technical Depth | 25% |
| Multi-Tenancy & Security | 20% |
| Scope & Testability | 10% |
| Migration & Rollback | 10% |

## Gate

- **>= 8:** PASS — proceed to task generation
- **6-7.9:** ITERATE — fix gaps, re-score
- **< 6:** REJECT — return to Phase 1

Before PASS, run `pnpm verify:prd-ready -- _prds/wip/prd-XXX-{name}.md`. If it fails, verdict is ITERATE unless the readiness report records an explicit waiver and rationale. After saving the readiness report, run `pnpm state:sync`.

## Emofy-Specific Checks

- [ ] IDs use `generateId('entity')` with prefix in `PREFIX_MAP`
- [ ] Permissions in `PERMISSION_MATRIX` (`@emofy/types`)
- [ ] No ghost roles (`"owner"` / `"workspaceAdmin"`)
- [ ] Queries use `OrgScopedRepository` or explicit `orgId`
- [ ] Cache via `CacheService`, queues via `QueueFactory`
